  "name": "Cybrix Deploy",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Deploys static sites to a live HTTPS URL via the Cybrix hosting service. Automatically detects Next.js export, Astro, Vite, Hugo, Eleventy, and plain HTML. Returns a live URL on *.cbrx.cc in under 60 seconds.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `cybrix-deploy` (Deploys the current project to a live HTTPS URL via Cybrix).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install cybrix-deploy@claude-community` from `cybrixcc/cybrix-skills` (`plugins/cybrix-deploy`).\n\nDeploys static sites to a live HTTPS URL via the Cybrix hosting service. Automatically detects Next.js export, Astro, Vite, Hugo, Eleventy, and plain HTML. Returns a live URL on *.cbrx.cc in under 60 seconds.",
